{"candidateAnswer":"Around early to mid March 2023","evidence":"[D9:5 | 11:22 am on 13 March, 2023] Deborah: Thanks! My neighbors were interested in trying yoga, so I hosted a class for them on Friday. It was great to see everyone embrace and enjoy it. Here is our photo together.","itemId":"urn:uuid:bfc1c407-403c-5e0a-a5ef-bcbdcf859a4f","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:6a01ada51b98452bbe9515ba13a4abd015fba9593495abdc38f6ea20d7c3f68a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Deborah start the yoga class in the neighborhood?","referenceAnswer":"Friday before 13 March, 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"6a01ada51b98452bbe9515ba13a4abd015fba9593495abdc38f6ea20d7c3f68a"}}]}